1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:12,919
Writing, task one. Form number 21. You want to enrol your child in a nursery school. Answer the questions in the application. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

2
00:00:13,767 --> 00:00:16,351
How old is your child and what do they like doing?

3
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,230
My daughter is four and she likes drawing, singing and playing outside.

4
00:00:32,267 --> 00:00:34,589
Why do you want to send your child to our nursery?

5
00:00:45,233 --> 00:00:49,698
I want to send her to your nursery because it is close to home and has a big garden.

6
00:00:50,733 --> 00:00:52,716
When can the child attend the nursery?

7
00:01:03,367 --> 00:01:07,361
The child can attend every day from seven in the morning until four in the afternoon.

8
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:18,429
Fill in form 21 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe to the channel — there's a new video every day.
